Embedded, in the Northpay app and authorisation. Limits in your app. In the Northpay app: groceries, $64, authorised inside the $200 limit. A stroller, $289, over $200, waits for a yes. Approve $289. You authorise. Checkout stays at the store.

4
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:20.450
Hosted, Mini-Stores for Northpay merchants. Mini-Stores for your merchants, hosted by us. Littlestep, a Northpay merchant, published. pantrybox, published, with its own checkout. Petal and Stem, in draft. We host them. Your merchants sell to agents.

5
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.450
Two paths. Different jobs. Embedded: limits in your app, at authorisation. Hosted: we host stores for your merchants. Start with one. Add the other.

6
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.950
Agent payments customers trust. Customers set the limits, in your app. You authorise each payment, checkout stays at the store. We never hold money, or sell ranking.

